@learningBaseUrl = https://learning.example.invalid
@userJwt = appwrite-user-jwt
@sessionId = active-session-id
@operationKey = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### Abandon an active Learning session
POST {{learningBaseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/abandon
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Idempotency-Key: {{operationKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 0
}

### Complete a session and stage its learning effects once
POST {{learningBaseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
Idempotency-Key: 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedRevision": 1
}
